  universal horizon censors arbitrarily fast modes (r_h -> 3M/2 as c_s -> infinity); and because no
  observation bounds a spin-0 gravitational-sector speed from above.  It is forced because
  c_s^2 = (2-K_B) g_N/(g_phi |K_2|) contains no a_0 and no kernel shape: the Solar System's own
  ephemerides, which bound g_phi, therefore bound c_s from BELOW at several hundred c.  L13's label
